{"objects":[
{"kind":"panel","id":"a9de4602-ece9-487e-9bd9-81e546e5b358","type":"59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c","name":"Panel","nick":"OpenSees script","desc":"A panel for custom notes and text values","box":[300,300,520,640],"src":[],"text":"wipe\nmodel BasicBuilder -ndm 2 -ndf 3\n\n# A portal frame 6 m wide and 4 m tall, in kN and m.\nnode 1 0.0 0.0\nnode 2 6.0 0.0\nnode 3 0.0 4.0\nnode 4 6.0 4.0\nfix 1 1 1 1\nfix 2 1 1 1\n\n# HEB 300 columns: A 149.1 cm2, I 25 170 cm4. IPE 400 beam: A 84.46 cm2, I 23 130 cm4. Steel, E 210 GPa.\ngeomTransf PDelta 1\ngeomTransf Linear 2\nelement elasticBeamColumn 1 1 3 0.01491 2.1e8 2.517e-4 1\nelement elasticBeamColumn 2 2 4 0.01491 2.1e8 2.517e-4 1\nelement elasticBeamColumn 3 3 4 0.008446 2.1e8 2.313e-4 2\n\n# 20 kN/m down on the beam, 30 kN along x at its left end.\ntimeSeries Linear 1\npattern Plain 1 1 {\n    eleLoad -ele 3 -type -beamUniform -20.0\n    load 3 30.0 0.0 0.0\n}\n\nconstraints Plain\nnumberer RCM\nsystem BandGeneral\ntest NormDispIncr 1.0e-8 10\nalgorithm Newton\nintegrator LoadControl 0.1\nanalysis Static\nanalyze 10\n\n# What came out: puts prints to the log of Run Analysis.\nreactions\nputs \"Sway at the top: [format %.2f [expr 1000.0 * [nodeDisp 3 1]]] mm\"\nputs \"Base shear: [format %.1f [expr -([nodeReaction 1 1] + [nodeReaction 2 1])]] kN\"\nputs \"Vertical reactions: [format %.1f [nodeReaction 1 2]] and [format %.1f [nodeReaction 2 2]] kN\"\nputs \"Moments at the feet: [format %.1f [nodeReaction 1 3]] and [format %.1f [nodeReaction 2 3]] kNm\"\nwipe","colour":[255,255,250,90]},
{"kind":"component","id":"c026c2d7-f5f1-451c-8e27-02aec864254d","type":"4d46782d-0abe-4097-8040-d9607c645165","name":"Custom code (Alpaca4d)","nick":"Your own script","desc":"Add a custom OpenSees code","box":[940,300,105,58],"pivot":[991,329],"inputs":[{"id":"22e15cf7-4dc9-44b5-a0a1-27910ae8cbe0","name":"AlpacaModel","nick":"AlpacaModel","box":[942,302,34,27],"src":[]},{"id":"893643cb-e39a-460f-a0ae-7718b1a2db1b","name":"CustomCode","nick":"CustomCode","box":[942,329,34,27],"src":["a9de4602-ece9-487e-9bd9-81e546e5b358"]}],"outputs":[{"id":"f8745c44-9c57-4ca8-99e5-885f5100cc4e","name":"AlpacaModel","nick":"AlpacaModel","box":[1006,302,37,27],"src":[]},{"id":"3b9e87b5-8649-4c3c-9c58-e523e69440ed","name":"Tcl","nick":"Tcl","box":[1006,329,37,27],"src":[]}]},
{"kind":"component","id":"936eb1dd-42af-4c05-b7ba-6beb1b43ae8d","type":"8c1f5a3e-2d74-4b96-a0e8-7f3b19d6c452","name":" Run Analysis (Alpaca4d)","nick":"Run it as it stands","desc":"Writes the assembled model out as an OpenSees script, solves it, and returns the model with its results attached.\nResults are recorded to a recorder.mpco file beside the Grasshopper document and read back by the 08_NumericalOutput components; an MPCO Recorder connected to Assemble Model chooses what the file holds, and what it is called. When a run fails the AlpacaModel output comes out empty - read the log output to find out why.","box":[1085,300,105,68],"pivot":[1136,334],"inputs":[{"id":"5bc582c4-3dd9-4700-82cd-6a2aacfd8a0b","name":"AlpacaModel","nick":"AlpacaModel","box":[1087,302,34,32],"src":["f8745c44-9c57-4ca8-99e5-885f5100cc4e"]},{"id":"cdc14e17-265c-4424-8356-30ab8e28fdbb","name":"Settings","nick":"Settings","box":[1087,334,34,32],"src":[]}],"outputs":[{"id":"6d63c010-49ed-470a-8e60-fab4f512f9d5","name":"AlpacaModel","nick":"AlpacaModel","box":[1151,302,37,32],"src":[]},{"id":"f71e72bc-e054-48a6-bf1c-028d62d35eb0","name":"log","nick":"log","box":[1151,334,37,32],"src":[]}]},
