{"kind":"group","id":"9915087f-9a35-4355-ba60-86b3912bd37c","type":"c552a431-af5b-46a9-a8a4-0fcbc27ef596","name":"Group","nick":"2 - Custom Code: no model wired in, so the script is the whole model; Run Analysis runs it as it stands","desc":"A group of Grasshopper objects","box":[0,0,0,0],"colour":[50,66,136,247],"members":["c026c2d7-f5f1-451c-8e27-02aec864254d","936eb1dd-42af-4c05-b7ba-6beb1b43ae8d"]},
{"kind":"group","id":"f05ae631-5ef3-4686-b9c4-a36a677ff993","type":"c552a431-af5b-46a9-a8a4-0fcbc27ef596","name":"Group","nick":"3 - What came back","desc":"A group of Grasshopper objects","box":[0,0,0,0],"colour":[40,42,45,49],"members":["d7ec9489-f701-4fb4-b341-aab4be5b03d6","2170e89b-4731-42cc-bcaf-f4439b9f632d"]},
{"kind":"panel","id":"73c3fbde-5982-43d2-b369-fb1e11a01058","type":"59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c","name":"Panel","nick":"Custom script","desc":"A panel for custom notes and text values","box":[300,60,900,200],"src":[],"text":"Custom script - an OpenSees Tcl script of your own, run from Grasshopper.\n\nThe script is typed into the panel, a line per item: a steel portal frame 6 m wide and 4 m tall, HEB 300 columns built in at their feet, an IPE 400 beam, 20 kN/m on the beam and 30 kN pushing its top sideways.\n\nCustom Code takes it with no model wired in, so the script is the whole model. Run Analysis has \"Do not use settings\" ticked in its right-click menu: it adds no recorders and no analysis, and runs the script as it stands. What the script prints with puts comes back in its log.\n\nPaste your own script over this one to reach anything of OpenSees that Alpaca4d has no component for. To add a few lines to a model built with Alpaca4d's components instead, wire the model into Custom Code, and untick \"Do not use settings\": the lines go after the model, before the recorders and the analysis.","colour":[255,255,250,90]}
],
